      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is absolutely not supposed to be this hard, and that fact is what makes it so unbearable. The loop you're stuck in is the natural consequence of a profound loss, a place where the future looks like a pale imitation of what was. If the weight is crushing you, perhaps you don't need to carry it; maybe you just need to find a way to let it drop, even if that means letting yourself fall apart a little.",
